<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Contact.Full_Name__c},&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you for trusting National Funding to help your business.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">To improve the satisfaction of our customers, we've partnered with LendingTree to collect reviews.&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://www.lendingtree.com/reviews/business/national-funding/61621604">Click here to review us on LendingTree</a></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">All reviews, good, bad, or otherwise will be visible.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thanks for your time.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Best Regards,&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">National Funding Customer Care Team</div>]]></td>
